        "title_B9kbqy": {
          "type": "title",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Beer tastes <span class=\"text-bg\">better</span> when it’s brewed with <span class=\"text-bg blue\">care.</span>",
            "title_size": "smaller"
          }
        },
        "textbox_AkWaW4": {
          "type": "textbox",
          "settings": {
            "textbox": "<p>At Long Point Brewing Co., we take looking after our patch of coastline seriously. We’re lucky enough to call the <strong>Kennedy Bay foreshore</strong> home — an environment shaped by the ancient <strong>Beecher Dune Formation,</strong> a system of coastal limestone ridges and dunes that have been sculpted over thousands of years by wind, waves, and shifting sands. Nestled here is one of WA’s rare <strong>Threatened Ecological Communities</strong>, home to unique plants and wildlife that deserve to be celebrated and protected.</p><p>So, while we’re in the business of brewing beer and serving good food, we’re also in the business of being good neighbours to our environment.<br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
